{
 "schemaVersion": "verdance-field-effects/2.0",
 "notes": "Field effects v2 (2026-10-29): a stronger self effect plus a weaker conditional aura that reaches the company members who match it. Source of truth; tools/sync_field_effects.py generates va_field_effects.lua.",
 "rules": {
  "auraCap": 0.15,
  "frictionFloor": -0.06,
  "bondBoost": 1.5,
  "frictionFrac": 0.4,
  "auraRadius": 650,
  "nearRadius": 600,
  "crowd": 3,
  "hurt": 0.5,
  "tickFrames": 30,
  "terrainGain": 0.35,
  "terrainFloor": -0.15,
  "selfBonus": [
   0.2,
   0.4
  ],
  "notes": [
   "Self effect: the hero and its own pack, 20-40%, with an optional condition. Grows with XP like before (nothing green, all of it at 2.4 XP).",
   "Aura: other company units that match its tags/axes/units, at most +15% per stat in total, recomputed every second.",
   "Bonds: a bonded hero's pack always takes the aura and takes it x1.5. A rival's pack never takes it; near the aura it suffers friction instead (-40% of the aura, floor -6%).",
   "Home ground: the self effect grows up to +35% on a map whose pressure matches the hero's strong axes, and shrinks up to -15% on one that fights them.",
   "Units without a hero (built armies, structures) match by what they are: air = sky, boats/hovers/amphibians = water, builders = craft, structures = pad and hold, fusions = kind fusion."
  ]
 },
